      "message": "Merge upstream/main into issue/1614-toolchange-clearance\n\nConflicts:\n- assets/posts/tormach.cps: the state block. This branch added\n  clearZ (#1614); main (#1650) added afterAsk and setupNext (#1532).\n  Kept all three. No logic conflict.\n- 4 Tormach contour goldens (#1577 climb): took main's side, then\n  regenerated with WRITE_GOLDEN=1 (conformance, program_units). Each\n  differs from main by this PR's one G0 Z line only.\n\nRefs #1614\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
